# A fireball that starts while the camera is beyond its maximum distance is never heard, even when the camera then
# comes back while the sound would still play. Run it with --layout layouts/sound-fade.jsonc; tools/WavLevel on
# play-out/sound-fade-start/frame.wav from 5.3 to 7.3 seconds reads silence.
wait 0.2
select Vorcha6
attack Sensor5
wait 4
hold Left 1.2
hold Right 1.2
wait 1.5
expect Sensor5 destroyed = true
